WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.073 --> 00:00:20.690
Snow White ran deep into the forest.

2
00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:25.881
Branches pulled her hair.

3
00:00:25.882 --> 00:00:31.028
Thorns scratched her arms and hands.

4
00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:38.524
Snow White climbed over rocks and tree roots.

5
00:00:38.525 --> 00:00:43.213
At last she stopped to rest.

6
00:00:43.214 --> 00:00:47.033
"How big is this forest?" Snow White said.

7
00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:49.891
"I've walked for hours.

8
00:00:49.892 --> 00:00:53.350
Now I'm lost, and it's getting late."

9
00:00:53.351 --> 00:00:57.763
Dark shadows stretched across the forest floor.

10
00:00:57.764 --> 00:01:01.090
A chilly wind shook tree branches.

11
00:01:01.091 --> 00:01:07.350
Dead leaves blew through the air.

12
00:01:07.351 --> 00:01:10.522
"I must find shelter," Snow White said.

13
00:01:10.523 --> 00:01:12.731
She looked around.

14
00:01:12.732 --> 00:01:14.627
"But where?"

15
00:01:14.628 --> 00:01:16.405
Snap!

16
00:01:16.406 --> 00:01:18.668
Snow White held her breath.

17
00:01:18.669 --> 00:01:20.863
She stared into the darkness.

18
00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:24.720
Was the hunter coming back for her?

19
00:01:24.721 --> 00:01:32.019
Snow White ran.

20
00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.939
Branches hit her face.

21
00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.744
Her foot caught a tree root.

22
00:01:37.745 --> 00:01:43.789
Snow White tumbled down a hill.

23
00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:47.463
When she sat up, she saw a pair of eyes.

24
00:01:47.464 --> 00:01:49.826
"A wolf!" she thought.

25
00:01:49.827 --> 00:01:55.238
Growling, the wolf stepped closer.

26
00:01:55.239 --> 00:02:02.297
The wolf looked deep into Snow White's eyes.

27
00:02:02.298 --> 00:02:05.127
Suddenly the wolf's face changed.

28
00:02:05.128 --> 00:02:09.172
The wolf wagged its tail and then ran off.

29
00:02:09.173 --> 00:02:13.253
"That was strange," Snow White thought.

30
00:02:13.254 --> 00:02:18.548
As Snow White stood up, she saw something.

31
00:02:18.549 --> 00:02:22.394
A faint light twinkled through the trees.

32
00:02:22.395 --> 00:02:29.137
Snow White gasped.

33
00:02:29.138 --> 00:02:32.902
"I see a house!"
